            "text": "Native faces now carry physical SFNT table evidence across the same interface as fontkit faces. Each platform helper queries the selected face for sbix/COLR/CPAL/CBDT/CBLC/SVG tables; reconstructing the directory here removes the last PostScript-name color heuristic and lets the shared Blink table-pair predicate decide capability.",
