            "text": "The helper bbox is translated by the same learned outline offset as the path commands before entering the font-like glyph interface. This keeps MathML ink evidence and emitted helper outlines in one coordinate space; shaped records reuse the already-fetched by-id bbox rather than approximating from ascent.",
            "markdown": "The helper bbox is translated by the same learned outline offset as the path commands before entering the font-like glyph interface. This keeps MathML ink evidence and emitted helper outlines in one coordinate space; shaped records reuse the already-fetched by-id bbox rather than approximating from ascent."
