          "guid": "mt5lc7cai9lxps2p",
          "message": {
            "text": "One native logical question now owns system-ui identity on all three platforms. macOS reuses the checked-in MatchSystemUIFont CoreText transcription, Linux reuses the Skia/fontconfig family-style matcher with the browser's renderer preference value, and Windows composes the live menu metric with DirectWrite style matching; no platform face name is fitted or committed as an answer.",
            "markdown": "One native logical question now owns system-ui identity on all three platforms. macOS reuses the checked-in MatchSystemUIFont CoreText transcription, Linux reuses the Skia/fontconfig family-style matcher with the browser's renderer preference value, and Windows composes the live menu metric with DirectWrite style matching; no platform face name is fitted or committed as an answer."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/render/glyph-helper.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 1950,
                  "endLine": 2014,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "export function resolveSystemUiFontFace(\n  style: InstalledFontStyle & { size?: number } = {},\n  linuxRendererSystemFamily?: string,\n): SystemUiFontFace | null {\n  const weight = style.weight ?? 400;\n  const italic = style.italic === true || (style.slant ?? 0) !== 0;\n  const slant = style.slant ?? (italic ? 1 : 0);\n  const stretch = style.stretch ?? 100;\n\n  if (hostPlatform() === \"darwin\") {\n    if (!isGlyphHelperAvailable()) return null;\n    try {\n      const resp = callHelper({\n        fonts: [{\n          ref: \"system-ui\",\n          size: style.size ?? 16,\n          systemUI: true,\n          cssWeight: weight,\n          cssSlant: slant,\n          cssWidth: stretch,\n        }],\n        queries: [{ type: \"meta\", fontRef: \"system-ui\" }],\n      });\n      const r = resp.results[0];\n      if (r?.type !== \"meta\" || r.resolution !== \"systemUI\"\n          || r.postscriptName == null || r.postscriptName === \"\") return null;\n      return {\n        route: \"coretext-ui-font\",\n        familyName: r.familyName ?? \"\",\n        postscriptName: r.postscriptName,\n        systemFamily: null,\n        ...(r.ctAxes != null ? { ctAxes: r.ctAxes } : {}),\n      };\n    } catch {\n      return null;\n    }\n  }\n\n  if (hostPlatform() === \"linux\") {\n    const systemFamily = linuxRendererSystemFamily?.trim() || \"sans\";\n    const matched = resolveLinuxFamilyMatch(systemFamily, { weight, italic, stretch });\n    if (matched == null || matched.postscriptName === \"\") return null;\n    return {\n      route: \"renderer-system-family\",\n      familyName: matched.family,\n      postscriptName: matched.postscriptName,\n      systemFamily,\n    };\n  }\n\n  if (hostPlatform() === \"win32\") {\n    const systemFamily = resolveSystemUiFamily();\n    if (systemFamily == null || systemFamily === \"\") return null;\n    const matched = resolveInstalledFont(systemFamily, { weight, italic, slant, stretch });\n    if (matched == null || matched.postscriptName === \"\") return null;\n    return {\n      route: \"windows-menu-font\",\n      familyName: matched.familyName || systemFamily,\n      postscriptName: matched.postscriptName,\n      systemFamily,\n      ...(matched.resolvedAxes != null ? { axes: matched.resolvedAxes } : {}),\n    };\n  }\n\n  return null;"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
